msgstr "Refreshes passive checks. The 404 audit and the transactional Data Layer test retain separate controls in their respective sections."

#: includes/system-check/seo-core-validation.php:510
msgid ""
"Los tests se ejecutan en una sola pasada; cada vista solo organiza y filtra "
