msgstr "Tests run in a single pass; each view only organizes and filters the results."

#: includes/system-check/seo-core-validation.php:550
msgid ""
"La auditoría se divide en tres peticiones independientes. Los resultados se "
"acumulan y cada bloque puede repetirse sin volver a ejecutar los demás."
msgstr "The audit is split into three independent requests. Results accumulate and each batch can be rerun without repeating the others."

